      hu: ["Az üzlet 1920-ban indult egy útmenti gyümölcsárusító bódéval.", "A boysenberry hibrid gyümölcsöt itt termesztették először nagyban.", "A 'Ghost Town' részleget 1940-ben építették fel a vendégeknek.", "A GhostRider hullámvasút 1382 méter hosszú pályával rendelkezik.", "1997 óta a Cedar Fair vidámpark-üzemeltető cég tulajdona.", "Évente több mint 4 millió látogatót fogad a komplexum."],
      ro: ["Afacerea a început în 1920 cu un simplu stand de fructe de pădure.", "Walter Knott a hibridizat și comercializat fructul boysenberry.", "Orașul fantomă (Ghost Town) a fost inaugurat oficial în 1940.", "Roller coaster-ul GhostRider atinge înălțimi de peste 36 de metri.", "Parcul a fost vândut companiei Cedar Fair la sfârșitul anului 1997.", "Găzduiește cel mai vechi festival al fructelor de pădure din regiune."],
      en: ["The farm began as a small roadside berry stand in 1920.", "Walter Knott successfully commercialized the boysenberry hybrid here.", "Ghost Town, the first themed area, was established in 1940.", "GhostRider opened in 1998 as a massive wooden roller coaster.", "The park was acquired by Cedar Fair Entertainment in 1997.", "Attracts approximately 4 million visitors annually to Buena Park."],
